&lt;p&gt;flaconi is an&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;lila-hg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; and welcomes and encourages all qualified&amp;nbsp; from all backgrounds and identities, regardless of ethnicity, race, gender identity, migration background, national origin, disability status, sexual orientation, religion, or age to apply.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you require specific support during the application or interview process – e.g. live captions, more time for the interview or the task in a different format – just let us know so that we can adapt the process accordingly. We will do our best to make this possible.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are seeking a (Senior) Data Scientist (all genders) to join a dynamic team of five within our DATA department. You&#39;ll dive into diverse challenges including training and deploying machine learning models, developing Generative AI and Agentic AI solutions, and statistical modeling. We believe in flat hierarchies, which means you&#39;ll work closely with colleagues of various seniorities in a fun environment. You&#39;ll play a key role in extracting valuable insights and developing data and AI solutions to optimize our e-commerce platform across Europe, taking end-to-end ownership of your projects and collaborating closely with business stakeholders along the way. Your contributions will have a direct impact on business decisions and process efficiency across a wide spectrum of unique use cases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;Employ statistical techniques and machine learning algorithms for regression, classification, and clustering (e.g., Gradient Boosting, Random Forest, Hierarchical Clustering, ensemble methods).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;Develop and productionalize Generative AI and Agentic AI solutions alongside modern NLP techniques using transformer architectures (e.g., BERT, GPT).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;Utilize time-series forecasting methods (e.g., ARIMA, LSTM, DeepAR, Prophet) for predictive modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot;&gt;Conduct exploratory data analysis (EDA), advanced feature engineering, and dimensionality reduction (PCA, t-SNE).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot;&gt;Develop and implement deep learning models in PyTorch, TensorFlow, or Keras while leveraging transfer learning strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,5,0&quot;&gt;Showcase your skills across key e-commerce data science use cases including demand forecasting, churn and CLTV modeling, pricing, customer segmentation, recommender systems, and personalization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,6,0&quot;&gt;Handle large-scale datasets using distributed computing frameworks (Apache Spark) on a tech stack comprising Python (PySpark, pandas, NumPy, scikit-learn, LightGBM), SQL, Databricks (Data Lakehouse &amp;amp; ML platform), AWS (S3, Lambda, EC2, SageMaker, Bedrock), GitHub, and AI-augmented tools (Claude, Copilot) while collaborating directly to proactively address stakeholder business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot;&gt;Bring a minimum of 3 years of hands-on experience in developing and deploying machine learning solutions for real-world business problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2,0&quot;&gt;Demonstrate background exposure to &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;35&quot;&gt;e-commerce (ideal)&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;55&quot;&gt;fintech&lt;/strong&gt;, or fast-paced &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;78&quot;&gt;agency&lt;/strong&gt; environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;12,3,0&quot;&gt;Demonstrate hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;37&quot;&gt;Databricks as a Data &amp;amp; AI platform (required)&lt;/strong&gt; alongside cloud platforms such as AWS, GCP, or Azure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;12,4,0&quot;&gt;Prove hands-on experience in building, productionalizing, and deploying Generative AI or Agentic AI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;12,5,0&quot;&gt;Apply hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;31&quot;&gt;MLOps practices and tools (required)&lt;/strong&gt; for end-to-end model lifecycle management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;12,6,0&quot;&gt;Possess a strong grasp of core data science principles to select the most appropriate techniques, combined with advanced proficiency in SQL, Python (PySpark, scikit-learn, NumPy, matplotlib, pandas), and AI-augmented development tools (Claude, Copilot).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;12,7,0&quot;&gt;Communicate exceptionally in English (written and verbal) to articulate complex concepts to non-technical stakeholders, driving projects with full end-to-end ownership as a collaborative team player.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
