&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;AI Notice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use AI-powered tools to streamline and support individual steps in our recruiting process. For example, these tools help our recruiting team identify suitable candidates, prioritize applications, and gain insights relevant to recruiting. The AI does not make any hiring decisions. Every application is reviewed and evaluated by people, and all hiring decisions are made under human supervision and responsibility. Our AI system is regularly reviewed for potential biases and holds ISO 42001 certification for AI governance. If you have any questions about our use of AI or would like an explanation of the criteria, please feel free to contact our Talent Acquisition team at ----- at any time.&lt;/p&gt;
